stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PluginIngress
  PluginIngress: 外部 Agent / IDE / CLI / Workflow
  PluginIngress --> Intent
  Intent: R0 意图识别
  Intent --> Route: R1 定位 subject/domain/route
  Route --> Abstraction: R2 抽象判型
  Abstraction --> FAMEScore: R3 FAME 动态路线评分
  FAMEScore --> GoalGate: 定义球门
  GoalGate: GoalGate / success condition / quality gates
  GoalGate --> GoalPath: scoped beam traversal
  GoalPath: GoalPath + 剪枝原因
  GoalPath --> ContextTrim: R4 上下文裁剪
  ContextTrim --> ToolPlan: R5 工具候选
  ToolPlan --> Gate: R6 权限与质量门
  Gate --> ToolManual: 通过
  ToolManual: 按需读取工具说明书
  ToolManual --> Enforcement: 提交 ProposedAction
  Enforcement: 强制检查 state/scope/route/manual/FAME/permission/quality
  Enforcement --> Execute: ApprovedAction + approval_token
  Enforcement --> HumanConfirm: 阻断或高风险
  Gate --> HumanConfirm: 高风险/冲突/权限
  HumanConfirm --> Execute: 确认
  HumanConfirm --> LogOnly: 暂停或降级
  Execute --> Review: R8 结果审查
  Review --> Fix: 未通过
  Fix --> FAMEUpdate
  Review --> FAMEUpdate: 通过
  FAMEUpdate --> SummaryWrite: R9 FAME 更新
  SummaryWrite --> ContextRelease: R10 摘要写回
  ContextRelease --> ClockSchedule: 设置提醒/恢复点/自我迭代
  ClockSchedule --> KnowledgePatch: 可选补充知识网
  KnowledgePatch: KnowledgePatchProposal / Review
  KnowledgePatch --> [*]
  LogOnly --> SummaryWrite
